<title>POLAND: GDANSKI OCT NET RISES TO PLN 14.65 MLN.</title>
<headline>GDANSKI OCT NET RISES TO PLN 14.65 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 14.65 vs    9.53</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   20.21 vs   14.61</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 35.59 vs   28.73</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	63.24 vs   55.43</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 84.24 vs   92.86</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  138.58 vs  170.22</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		327.54 vs  286.15</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     608.35 vs  529.21</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Gdanski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
